(18,176,944,$q$Guangzhou Opera House$q$,$q$Zaha Hadid's two pebble-shaped halls by the Pearl River.$q$,$q$20-70$q$,'golden','17:15','want','planned',37,'spot',null,23.117766,113.316749,$q$Walk around the outside; the facets catch the low sun. Sunset 5:42.$q$,$q$- The angled facets with low light raking across them — 20-70.
