(18,176,944,$q$Canton Tower from Haixinsha$q$,$q$The tower lighting up across the Pearl River.$q$,$q$35mm / 20-70$q$,'blue','18:00','must','planned',38,'area',400,23.114492,113.318641,$q$The Haixinsha riverside, right across from the tower. Blue hour until about 6:07.$q$,$q$- The tower and its reflection in the river — 35mm or 20-70, braced on the railing.
