(18,182,915,$q$Tsim Sha Tsui promenade, last night$q$,$q$The island skyline one more time.$q$,$q$35mm / 85mm$q$,'night','19:30','want','planned',46,'area',600,22.294147,114.175789,$q$The promenade from the Clock Tower to the Avenue of Stars.$q$,$q$- The island skyline, braced on the wall — 35mm.
- People taking photos with the skyline — 85mm.
- The lit Clock Tower and the ferry pier — 35mm.$q$,$q$No tripod: brace on the wall. 35mm at f/2, about 1/4s, ISO 1600, 2-second timer. If you bring the mini tripod, this is a spot for it: ISO 100, f/8, 5–15s for smooth water.$q$,false)
