(160, array['35mm','85mm'], $q$Arrival night: just the two primes for the Bund. 35 for the skyline, braced on the wall; 85 for people at the rail.$q$),
(161, array['20-70mm','70-200mm'], $q$Zooms for West Bund and Wukang Road. The hotel is minutes from Xintiandi, so swap to the primes there tonight if you go.$q$),
(162, array['70-200mm','20-70mm','35mm'], $q$The Bund at 7: 70-200 for the stone fronts and the tai chi, 20-70 for the skyline. The 35 rides along for Waibaidu at blue hour and the bar after; the 85 stays.$q$),
